[I] A small and simple console-based live bandwidth monitor

[T] Bandwidth Monitor NG (bwm-ng) is a small and simple console based live
[T] network and disk I/O bandwidth monitor for Linux, BSD, Solaris and
[T] others. It supports many statistics sources, dynamically added
[T] interfaces and output as curses, plain text, CSV or HTML.

[U] https://www.gropp.org/

